രണ്ട് slot ഉള്ള bounded composition family-യുടെ exact countയും one-based unrank-ഉം പരിശോധിക്കുന്ന clean Stage 1 പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, total സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, lower bound സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, upper bound സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, one-based rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, feasible first-value lower സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, feasible first-value upper സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, family count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, തിരഞ്ഞെടുക്കപ്പെട്ട ആദ്യ ഭാഗം സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, തിരഞ്ഞെടുക്കപ്പെട്ട രണ്ടാം ഭാഗം സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, താൽക്കാലിക bound സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, input-output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: രണ്ട് slot-ിൽ lexicographic family interval കണക്കാക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: total, lo, hi, rank വായിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: lower=max(lo,total-hi).
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and Romeo.
 Are you better than Juliet?
 If so, let us proceed to scene III.
 Let us proceed to scene IV.

Scene III: lower=total-hi.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Macbeth]
Viola:
 You are as good as myself.
 Let us proceed to scene V.

Scene IV: lower=lo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Juliet and Macbeth]
Juliet:
 You are as good as myself.

Scene V: upper=min(hi,total-lo).
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and Juliet.
 Are you worse than Romeo?
 If so, let us proceed to scene VI.
 Let us proceed to scene VII.

Scene VI: upper=total-lo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Lady Macbeth]
Viola:
 You are as good as myself.
 Let us proceed to scene VIII.

Scene VII: upper=hi.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Lady Macbeth]
Romeo:
 You are as good as myself.

Scene VIII: interval ശൂന്യമാണോ എന്ന് നോക്കുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 Are you better than Lady Macbeth?
 If so, let us proceed to scene XII.

Scene IX: count=upper-lower+1.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Lady Macbeth and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.

Scene X: first=lower+rank-1, second=total-first.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of Macbeth and Othello.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and Cordelia.

Scene XI: count, first, second പുറത്തിടുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene XII: ശൂന്യ family: 0,0,0.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are nothing.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are nothing.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero:
 You are nothing.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
